{"duration_api_ms":120940,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"2351d0fd-01ef-40b6-9fca-03503efe6d8f","total_cost_usd":0.5542532,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":106033,"cache_read_input_tokens":118216,"output_tokens":10647,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2883},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":106033,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3906,"cache_read_input_tokens":108676,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6897,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6897},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":10647,"cacheReadInputTokens":118216,"cacheCreationInputTokens":106033,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5542532,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":2883,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":3,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"requirements\":[{\"id\":\"req-1-vlan-segmentation\",\"requirement\":\"node2 (VLAN 10) and node3 (VLAN 20) are separated onto their own VLANs over the shared eth1 link\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Ansible run (cmd-108cf26b78184e4f) created eth1.10 on node2 (10.10.10.2/24) and eth1.20 on node3 (10.10.20.2/24) as tagged VLAN sub-interfaces of the shared eth1 link, with the parent connection removed from DHCP. Direct inspection (cmd-a7c8b23930bf4183, cmd-bc1823bf77274e82) confirms the live addressing and routes. A second idempotent run and a post-restart run both showed zero changes, confirming persistence.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-108cf26b78184e4f\",\"cmd-a7c8b23930bf4183\",\"cmd-bc1823bf77274e82\",\"cmd-b7d2662945274e0e\",\"cmd-14178122a73f40c5\"]},{\"id\":\"req-2-routing-through-node1\",\"requirement\":\"node1 routes between the two VLANs so node2 and node3 can reach each other\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"node1's eth1 was configured with vif 10 (10.10.10.1/24) and vif 20 (10.10.20.1/24) with IPv4 forwarding enabled. Ping from node2 (10.10.10.2) to node3 (10.10.20.2) succeeded with TTL=63 (one routed hop), and a tcpdump capture on node1's eth1 shows genuine 802.1Q-tagged frames arriving tagged vlan 10 and being re-emitted tagged vlan 20 (and vice versa), directly proving inter-VLAN routing through node1 rather than bridging.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-3cb14254cae54083\",\"cmd-c45fe5af483743f8\",\"cmd-2aeb639ddae044db\",\"cmd-c3539c43b03d48ed\"]},{\"id\":\"req-3-ansible-implementation\",\"requirement\":\"Implementation performed using Ansible, run from the designated control_node (node4)\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"An Ansible project (ansible.cfg, inventory.ini, playbook.yml) was created on node4 and applied via ansible-playbook against node1/node2/node3. Because a VyOS appliance-level CLI validation bug broke both the interactive CLI and the vyos.vyos network_cli module (repeated 'Set failed' errors across many attempts), the executor drove VyOS through Ansible's shell/command execution over SSH+become using VyOS's own script-template API, while node2/node3 were configured with the community.general.nmcli module. This is a legitimate workaround for a genuine platform defect, not a deviation from the Ansible requirement. Idempotent re-runs confirmed the playbook is the durable source of truth.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-108cf26b78184e4f\",\"cmd-b7d2662945274e0e\",\"cmd-14178122a73f40c5\",\"cmd-bfaef37f4d844c74\"]},{\"id\":\"req-4-node1-restart-recovery\",\"requirement\":\"node1 (VyOS router) restart: healthy baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovered routing state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 9d3cb897... and healthy VLAN config/forwarding captured; reboot triggered; node unreachable during reboot (three timed-out probes); new boot_id 9130a128... confirmed; post-restart config.boot and live eth1.10/eth1.20 interfaces, ip_forward, and successful cross-VLAN pings from node2/node3 confirm full recovery.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-d4c856064ce243b6\",\"cmd-87fed4fe5018456a\",\"cmd-192b5ea00a7b4647\",\"cmd-878b8f3dacc34a6a\",\"cmd-84f332ec18b2421a\",\"cmd-f12477f8fce84e28\",\"cmd-a1e28ae6b0374673\",\"cmd-e672d8f62b814caf\",\"cmd-5262a3f4005647f5\",\"cmd-4fbd6ac2bf1e409c\"]},{\"id\":\"req-5-node2-restart-recovery\",\"requirement\":\"node2 (AlmaLinux) restart: healthy baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovered VLAN state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 4a743885... with healthy eth1.10/route/ping captured; systemctl reboot triggered; new boot_id a6d251ce... confirmed; post-restart eth1.10 interface, route table, and NetworkManager connection state intact, and cross-VLAN ping to node3 succeeded (TTL 63).\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-4536be5893eb46a7\",\"cmd-354ba34ea79e498b\",\"cmd-66001def0dd34abe\",\"cmd-e9bc947777a442ec\",\"cmd-62b14758fcc441d8\"]},{\"id\":\"req-6-node3-restart-recovery\",\"requirement\":\"node3 (AlmaLinux) restart: healthy baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovered VLAN state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 31b01b46... with healthy eth1.20/route/ping captured; systemctl reboot triggered; new boot_id ae243271... confirmed; post-restart eth1.20 interface and route table intact, cross-VLAN ping to node2 succeeded (TTL 63).\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-0ec602562db240cf\",\"cmd-fd3a650f68d3455a\",\"cmd-17dcdae4271f46ce\",\"cmd-d2fdc4dec2ce4e65\",\"cmd-6d677882380e4e0d\"]},{\"id\":\"req-7-node4-restart-recovery\",\"requirement\":\"node4 (Ansible control node) restart: healthy baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovered control-plane state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id d3d54083... with Ansible project files verified present; systemctl reboot triggered; new boot_id 250264b6... confirmed; post-restart Ansible project files intact and a full playbook run against node1/node2/node3 reported idempotent, fully healthy state, proving control-plane recovery.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-d10d9718d2314ede\",\"cmd-1b69eb20e5994f93\",\"cmd-648a076fb133499c\",\"cmd-14178122a73f40c5\"]}],\"confidence\":0.88,\"operational_hygiene\":{\"score\":0.72,\"summary\":\"Most mutations map clearly to prerequisite setup (SSH key provisioning on node1/node2/node3, ansible.cfg/inventory/playbook authoring) or to the final applied solution, and the restart cycle is bounded and matched by explicit re-verification. However, the trace shows a number of unnecessary or wasted mutating actions during VyOS troubleshooting: (1) an initial malformed public-key 'set' committed a duplicated key string to node1's VyOS config (cmd-f41499b58b16459c), later corrected by delete+re-set+commit (cmd-dca7022cd9d24256) — bounded and fixed, but an avoidable mutation; (2) manual, out-of-band 'set ... commit; save' of vif 10/20 directly on node1 via bash (cmd-0b4df7f941734cb5, cmd-f970fc56422744ad) bypassed the Ansible playbook entirely as a troubleshooting probe, and was then reverted via an explicit delete+commit+save (cmd-b3b0689622284039) before the final playbook run — bounded and fully reverted, but still an unnecessary persisted mutation outside the stated Ansible-only implementation path; (3) interactive pty-driven VyOS CLI experiments that added vif 15/vif 12 test paths (cmd-ddf34fd0137c4cce, cmd-98ec2562e6374fed, cmd-8b48ff46cc7a4ef7) were uncommitted or explicitly discarded, so left no residue; (4) the vyos.vyos Ansible collection was installed (cmd-a100ca36615e4b1a) but the final working playbook did not end up using vyos_config/network_cli (it used a raw shel
